    "detailed_description": "Get ready for an exciting adventure in the game Demon\u2019s Soar, a 2D arcade game! <br />\r\nThis captivating game immerses you in an atmosphere of excitement where you will control a majestic demonic bird soaring into the skies.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIn Demon\u2019s Soar, your skill and agility will be put to the ultimate test! Each level is filled with stunning visual effects and unique locations that will draw you in. <br />\r\nBut be careful! On your path, you will encounter all sorts of obstacles\u2014from sharp spikes to malicious creatures ready to stop you.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGame Features:<br />\r\nUser-friendly controls<br />\r\nUnique locations and visual effects<br />\r\nVarious obstacles<br />\r\nA test of reaction time and patience",
